    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. I'm also getting some pushback from the local neighborhood groups. They're saying this project will basically destroy the character of the area and ruin the quality of life for current residents. How should I address those concerns in my presentation without losing the momentum of the argument?",
